274
00:11:54,660 --> 00:11:58,100
but that stuff could be useful if there are certain clothes you want to wear.

275
00:11:58,820 --> 00:12:01,340
Well, I've been cooking pretty light.

276
00:12:01,660 --> 00:12:03,440
So how did this change happen so suddenly?

277
00:12:04,060 --> 00:12:04,900
Do you have any idea?

278
00:12:06,280 --> 00:12:09,400
For the most part, the way you eat seems fairly healthy to me.

279
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:12,900
Yeah. When I'm around you, it's dandy.

280
00:12:13,280 --> 00:12:16,080
The real damage happens when I get home. You feel me?

281
00:12:16,540 --> 00:12:17,660
Are you eating sweets?

282
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:20,840
Close, but I go for something a bit heavier than that.

283
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:22,500
Heavier?

284
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:32,720
You're kidding.

285
00:12:33,660 --> 00:12:35,480
I've been sending you home with breakfast.

286
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,160
It's four morning.

287
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:40,000
But you're eating it that night?

288
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:43,920
Mm-hmm.

289
00:12:55,220 --> 00:12:55,900
Interesting.

290
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,160
Then what do you eat for breakfast?

291
00:12:58,440 --> 00:13:00,980
Just the leftover bites that didn't make the bento.

292
00:13:00,980 --> 00:13:02,320
What does that even mean?

293
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,560
Um-yum-yum.

294
00:13:04,900 --> 00:13:05,940
Um-yum-yum.

295
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,440
Um-yum-yum.

296
00:13:07,820 --> 00:13:08,820
Um-yum-yum.

297
00:13:08,820 --> 00:13:10,200
Um-yum-yum.

298
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:11,040
More, please!

299
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,240
Um-yum-yum.

300
00:13:12,900 --> 00:13:13,700
Um-yum-yum.

301
00:13:13,700 --> 00:13:27,600
All right, if we combine the number of calories in each meal, we get about 50,000 calories per day.

302
00:13:28,460 --> 00:13:30,720
It's just food! Why do you look so scared?

303
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:33,940
It's not that I'm scared. I'm just a bit surprised.

304
00:13:34,340 --> 00:13:38,200
Your food is so gassed that I would feel crazy guilty to just stick it in the fridge.

305
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:39,540
Well, thank you.

306
00:13:39,540 --> 00:13:43,940
On the bright side, if you make a couple simple changes, you should be back to normal soon.

307
00:13:45,860 --> 00:13:46,340
Yay!

308
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:48,300
Huh?

309
00:13:49,180 --> 00:13:51,740
Whoa! I feel better already!

310
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:53,060
Some good news?

311
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:57,120
Tomorrow. Meet me after school. You and I have got some shopping to do.

312
00:13:57,460 --> 00:13:59,240
Sounds good. What are you buying?

313
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,180
You'll see.

314
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:07,900
Ta-da! Loose socks!

315
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:11,060
Those things are so long. People really wear these?

316
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:14,700
Some people wear them longer. They went up to 180 cm.

317
00:14:15,140 --> 00:14:18,220
To do it proper, you're supposed to stretch them out first.

318
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:19,180
Here!

319
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:21,840
Pinch my foot a hand, will ya?

320
00:14:22,020 --> 00:14:24,240
This feels so wrong. You just bought them.

321
00:14:24,460 --> 00:14:25,500
It's part of the game.

322
00:14:25,700 --> 00:14:28,620
According to Hikaru, the looser they are, the cuter they are.

323
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:29,120
Duh!

324
00:14:29,540 --> 00:14:29,960
There.

325
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:34,880
And done!

326
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:38,200
These chips are so cute!

327
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:41,760
And they're pretty warm, too.

328
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:43,880
I know!

329
00:14:44,620 --> 00:14:45,880
Take a pic of me, Gojo.

330
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:47,380
All right.

331
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:50,880
Here.

332
00:14:50,880 --> 00:14:59,680
I'm so saving up for one of these.

333
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,280
They're mad pricey.

334
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:02,400
It's a fat check.

335
00:15:05,680 --> 00:15:06,160
Huh?

336
00:15:06,600 --> 00:15:07,380
Is that...

337
00:15:07,920 --> 00:15:08,620
No way!

338
00:15:09,340 --> 00:15:10,680
You bought the DSLR?

339
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:12,260
Uh-huh.

340
00:15:12,380 --> 00:15:13,460
It got here yesterday!

341
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,400
I can't believe you got one!

342
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:17,280
I told you I'd buy it, so I did!

343
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:19,560
If Mama wants something, then Mama gets it!

344
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:20,040
Capiche?

345
00:15:20,160 --> 00:15:21,120
She's so determined!

346
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:23,000
It came with two sick lenses!

347
00:15:23,460 --> 00:15:25,700
The other is much bigger, so I started with this.

348
00:15:26,280 --> 00:15:26,680
Chicken!

349
00:15:26,940 --> 00:15:27,840
Isn't it wild?

350
00:15:28,020 --> 00:15:29,160
I'm literally in love!

351
00:15:29,300 --> 00:15:31,360
I've legit wanted life and can die happy!

352
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:34,520
I worked my butt off and did like a bajillion jobs

353
00:15:34,520 --> 00:15:35,880
to bring this baby home!

354
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:37,840
Yeah, I'm like peak excited!

355
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:39,560
Hang on!

356
00:15:40,040 --> 00:15:41,540
There are so many cameras available

357
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:42,840
and they all have different features.

358
00:15:43,340 --> 00:15:44,960
Tell me, how did you decide on that one?

359
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:46,180
You want the lure?

360
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:49,760
I'm just as clueless as you are

361
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:50,840
when it comes to this stuff,

362
00:15:50,980 --> 00:15:52,260
so I asked my girl Suzuka

363
00:15:52,260 --> 00:15:53,680
what kind of camera she rocks.

364
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,960
I use the Kiss M mirrorless

365
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,760
and it cost me about 80,000 yen.

366
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:58,720
Huh?

367
00:15:59,280 --> 00:16:00,920
About 80,000, huh?

368
00:16:02,120 --> 00:16:02,880
Hold up.

369
00:16:03,460 --> 00:16:05,200
Kiss M is such a cute name!

370
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:07,780
And the M stands for Maureen!

371
00:16:07,840 --> 00:16:08,840
It's meant for me!

372
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:09,940
I need it!

373
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,060
It's totally fate!

374
00:16:12,920 --> 00:16:13,940
Don't you think?

375
00:16:15,400 --> 00:16:18,820
A lot had happened in the time he'd known Maureen,

376
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:20,580
but in that moment,

377
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:25,280
her determination shook Wakuna to his very core.

378
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,840
Okay, I think I figured out the basics enough

379
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:33,080
to take a quick picture.

380
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:34,780
Your girl is ready too!

381
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:36,580
Cheese!

382
00:16:36,580 --> 00:16:40,240
I want to do a photo shoot with a new camera,

383
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:41,780
but I can't cosplay yet.

384
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:44,920
I figured a new hairstyle would help me feel sort of special.

385
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:46,140
Worth a shot.

386
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:48,660
So that's why you bought the loose socks, huh?

387
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:50,200
You got it, Goober!

388
00:16:50,640 --> 00:16:52,160
Come on, Mr. Photographer!

389
00:16:52,620 --> 00:16:53,420
Take a portrait!

390
00:16:53,880 --> 00:16:54,460
I'll try.

391
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:57,160
Now where would portrait mode be?

392
00:16:57,160 --> 00:16:58,820
Oh, hey!

393
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:04,720
Ready, set, go!

394
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:08,460
What's wrong?

395
00:17:09,260 --> 00:17:10,040
I, uh...

396
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:12,000
It's amazing!

397
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:13,660
The quality's incredible!

398
00:17:13,860 --> 00:17:14,100
Wow!

399
00:17:14,880 --> 00:17:16,740
When you zoom in, it's just as clear!

400
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:18,300
You're so hyped up!

401
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:19,880
I think you're more into it than me!

402
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:21,800
I might be.

403
00:17:22,460 --> 00:17:22,740
Ah!

404
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,040
It's just so awesome!

405
00:17:24,340 --> 00:17:26,860
I know high-quality cameras are supposed to take high-quality pictures,

406
00:17:26,980 --> 00:17:28,340
but I'm a complete and utter amateur!

407
00:17:28,620 --> 00:17:30,380
The fact that I can take incredible photos like this

408
00:17:30,380 --> 00:17:31,660
could seriously make me cry!

409
00:17:32,420 --> 00:17:33,620
It's so much fun.

410
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:35,740
Cameras at a whole new layer!

411
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:38,160
We're not done yet, dude!

412
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:39,060
Right.

413
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:44,260
Well, do I look good?

414
00:17:44,260 --> 00:17:51,540
I love that you're loving this!

415
00:17:54,580 --> 00:17:55,360
Another one?

416
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:57,360
I'm so glad I bought it!

417
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:01,060
I know I'm on a big diet right now,

418
00:18:01,200 --> 00:18:02,520
but once I'm done with all that,

419
00:18:02,820 --> 00:18:04,680
you and I should toads grab some monja.

420
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:07,020
I'd love to go while we're on winter break!

421
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,840
I'll message the gang to see if they're down, too.

422
00:18:09,840 --> 00:18:13,220
I need some mentai cheese mochi monja in my belly like yesterday!

423
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:16,760
Do you get cravings?

424
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:19,680
Of course you do!

425
00:18:20,220 --> 00:18:22,140
Cheesy stuff is my craving of choice.

426
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:24,720
We'll need to make reservations ASAP.

427
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:27,280
It's so not cool to pull up to a restaurant

428
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:28,960
with nine high schoolers out of the blue.

429
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:35,260
We should try out the food mode later.

430
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:36,880
No calories in a pic?

431
00:18:38,040 --> 00:18:40,020
Capture those delicious memories!

432
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:43,380
Let's test out the other lens.

433
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:45,380
It's for super far away shots.

434
00:18:47,220 --> 00:18:50,000
I'm curious to find out just how far I can get.

435
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:58,180
It is called kiss-em, after all.

436
00:18:58,500 --> 00:19:00,220
I'd lose that move in music bits.

437
00:19:01,300 --> 00:19:03,360
Did my sonic zoom scare you?

438
00:19:03,620 --> 00:19:04,880
I'm sorry about that.

439
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:07,380
I swear I didn't mean to blur up your artistry.

440
00:19:07,380 --> 00:19:11,300
I'm ready to be serious now.

441
00:19:11,760 --> 00:19:12,760
You wait right there!

442
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:14,680
I'll get extra far away!

443
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:20,140
It came out crystal clear.

444
00:19:20,140 --> 00:19:26,040
The photo quality is almost too high!

445
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:28,060
I gotta watch the faces I pull.

446
00:19:28,660 --> 00:19:30,280
The bouquet effect is so pretty!

447
00:19:30,420 --> 00:19:31,620
I'm glad you figured it out!

448
00:19:31,860 --> 00:19:34,380
You mentioned liking it before, and now I can see why.

449
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:35,400
Oh yeah!

450
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:37,460
There's a cosplay event this weekend.

451
00:19:38,020 --> 00:19:41,140
I kinda feel like it would be fun to go as a photographer this time.

452
00:19:41,900 --> 00:19:43,660
Apparently Amadei is gonna be there.

453
00:19:43,880 --> 00:19:44,780
I have to go!

454
00:19:45,260 --> 00:19:50,800
He's cosplaying Hokuto Neon, and I would literally keel over if I didn't get to experience all that cuteness in person!

455
00:19:51,220 --> 00:19:53,660
Suzuka should be there too, so I'm extra hyped!

456
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:55,580
Yeah, I was planning to go myself.

457
00:19:56,000 --> 00:19:56,600
For real?

458
00:19:56,600 --> 00:19:58,280
Hold on, Kojo.

459
00:19:58,540 --> 00:19:59,640
Are you gonna cosplay?

460
00:19:59,940 --> 00:20:01,380
You better show me, show me, show me, show me!

461
00:20:01,380 --> 00:20:02,100
It's not bad!

462
00:20:02,140 --> 00:20:03,100
Show me now, show me now, show me now!

463
00:20:03,100 --> 00:20:03,860
I would have told you!

464
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:09,220
Back during the last event, when we went to ACOS, I noticed something called Cosboard.

465
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:12,960
I looked it up, and it's popular for making props.

466
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,960
Oh, I've seen lots of prop masters use that.

467
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:18,160
I'd never heard of it, so I did some research.

468
00:20:18,820 --> 00:20:19,500
Look at this.

469
00:20:20,940 --> 00:20:21,380
Whoa!

470
00:20:21,680 --> 00:20:23,180
That's like so heaven cool!

471
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:24,420
I completely agree!

472
00:20:24,420 --> 00:20:27,040
I still can't get over those tiny details on the katana!

473
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:32,480
The artist who posted this is named Akira, and he has tons of videos that shed light on the whole prop-making process.

474
00:20:32,860 --> 00:20:33,260
Wow!

475
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:35,740
I was watching his page like a hawk.

476
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:39,520
I wanted to ask him some specific questions, but I was scared to bother him.

477
00:20:39,820 --> 00:20:42,380
Instead, I tried to take as much info from his clips as I could.

478
00:20:43,040 --> 00:20:46,240
But soon, the videos weren't enough, and I had to reach out!

479
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:47,800
Just to say I liked his work!

480
00:20:50,460 --> 00:20:52,800
It's too good to be true, but he responded!

481
00:20:52,800 --> 00:20:54,700
He was actually super nice!

482
00:20:54,920 --> 00:20:55,660
Shit, dude!

483
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:57,900
No wonder you've been in such a good mood.

484
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:58,720
Now you know!

485
00:20:59,040 --> 00:21:00,280
I'm over the moon about it!

486
00:21:00,500 --> 00:21:03,240
He said he'll be there this weekend, and said I could say hi!

487
00:21:03,740 --> 00:21:04,460
Dang, Gojo!

488
00:21:04,580 --> 00:21:05,880
You love this Akira guy!

489
00:21:06,360 --> 00:21:06,780
Yeah!

490
00:21:07,260 --> 00:21:09,140
There's just so much I'd like to ask him!

491
00:21:09,780 --> 00:21:12,400
Also, if you're on socials now, you should have told me!

492
00:21:12,580 --> 00:21:13,920
I want to follow you, doofus!

493
00:21:14,140 --> 00:21:15,640
But I haven't posted anything.

494
00:21:16,140 --> 00:21:17,940
I made an account so I could contact him.

495
00:21:18,380 --> 00:21:19,380
Gotta start somewhere!

496
00:21:19,380 --> 00:21:21,280
Good point.

497
00:21:22,040 --> 00:21:22,700
Here are mine.

498
00:21:27,820 --> 00:21:30,380
Hey, is it cool if we head to your place after this?

499
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:31,300
Of course!

500
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:32,860
Would you like to join us for dinner?

501
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,040
You know it!

502
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:35,860
But I've got other plans, too.

503
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:39,100
There's something that I'm dying to capture with the new camera!

504
00:21:41,160 --> 00:21:42,880
Look right into the lens!

505
00:21:43,580 --> 00:21:44,380
Ready, and...

506
00:21:44,380 --> 00:21:48,960
Oh, my!

507
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:51,160
Who is that handsome devil?

508
00:21:51,860 --> 00:21:53,960
This is a fancy camera, Maureen.

509
00:21:54,060 --> 00:21:55,520
You must have worked hard for it.

510
00:21:55,720 --> 00:21:56,600
Good for you.

511
00:21:57,260 --> 00:22:01,000
You're sweet, but I don't think I'm worthy of being your first model.

512
00:22:01,300 --> 00:22:02,020
You are!

513
00:22:02,200 --> 00:22:04,380
I came here specifically to take that pick.

514
00:22:04,380 --> 00:22:12,180
Give me a round of applause.

515
00:22:28,180 --> 00:22:28,580
Bye!

516
00:22:28,740 --> 00:22:29,380
Bye!

517
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:29,860
Bye!

518
00:22:29,920 --> 00:22:30,100
Bye!

519
00:22:30,260 --> 00:22:30,780
мин

520
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:33,140
Bye!

521
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:33,640
Bye!

522
00:22:33,640 --> 00:23:03,620
Thank you.

523
00:23:03,640 --> 00:23:33,620
Thank you.

524
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:36,640
Next time.

